<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CBANK SETS ONE-WEEK REV REPO AT MAX 39 PCT.</title>
<headline>CZECH CBANK SETS ONE-WEEK REV REPO AT MAX 39 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech central bank (CNB) on Thursday set a reverse repo tender to drain funds from the market with a maximum rate of 39 percent, down from the 45 percent maximum rate at a similar operation on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
